  "changes": [
    "Carry operation cancellation through all built-in tree/body/module analyzer requests; legacy providers retain each corresponding coverage override and check tokens at call boundaries.",
    "Own each concurrent L3 analyzer request with a linked child token; cancel/drain/observe its Ara task on every emit exit while retaining primary errors and secondary faults.",
    "Drain agent CancelAsync callbacks outside the scheduler lock before disposing the run CTS or marking idle; Watch/Recover follow human queue admission.",
    "Only a requested matching operation cancellation yields/requeues; unrelated OCE is a terminal compiler error without worker death.",
    "Tokenized prewarm restores the generator driver in finally. No unbounded Dispose join; existing host-process fallback remains.",
    "Capture launch budget before ALL startup modes; Mac background policy uses documented reversible self-process Darwin state instead of irreversible BSD nice. Any active human retains the captured budget, including across worker threads.",
    "Scheduling hints remain best effort with visible failures; worker-thread restoration is attempted separately. One-shot/editor/project modes retain background startup."
  ],
